y.ai/zh","privacyUrl":"https://linkly.ai/zh/privacy","publisherSupportUrl":"https://linkly.ai/docs/zh/community","publisherUrl":"https://linkly.ai/zh","purchaseUrl":"https://linkly.ai/zh/pricing","releaseNotes":"☁️ 云端嵌入服务正式发布：Pro 用户可切换到云端💡 Tips：云端嵌入是 Pro 功能，需要先登录 Linkly 账号，并确保有 Pro 版订阅。🚀 新功能：\n- 云端嵌入正式发布：Pro 用户可切换到云端嵌入服务，更快、语义搜索质量更高、更省资源。\n- 笔记：新增 时间轴导航。\n- 笔记：新增 标签筛选栏。\n⚡ 改进：\n- 改进扫描件被重复 OCR 的几率：带隐藏文本层的扫描 PDF 在检测合格后会直接采纳，不用再排队重跑一遍识别。\n- 杂志类「整页大图 + 可见文字」的排版页也不再被误判成扫描件。\n- 修复偶发的低配置机器索引长期停滞问题。\n- 提高了高性能索引模式对机器资源的使用率。\n- 云端知识库：百万字级超长文档不再索引失败，并且不会再连累同批次其他文档。\n- 云端知识库：索引速度大幅提升。\n🐛 Bug 修复：\n- 修复自定义模型（OpenAI 兼容、未上报上下文窗口）无法手动压缩对话的问题。\n- 修复某条笔记日期异常（如误填年份）时界面卡死数秒，以及跨夏令时时区（智利等）时间轴丢失最新一天的问题。\n- 统一了正文 #标签 的解析口径，前后端与不同编辑路径下的标签识别结果不再有差异。","tags":["人工智能","大语言模型","搜索","智能体","自主智能"]}},"longDescription":"Build an Agent-Ready knowledge base from your computer, easy to integrate with any AI Agent. Efficient retrieval, filtering, reading, and large-scale research. Supports PDF, DOCX, HTML, Markdown, Image (OCR), and many more formats.","name":"Linkly AI","packageUrl":"https://linkly.ai/","privacyUrl":"https://linkly.ai/privacy","publisher":"linkly","publisherSupportUrl":"https://linkly.ai/docs/en/community","publisherUrl":"https://linkly.ai/","purchaseUrl":"https://linkly.ai/pricing","releaseNotesUrl":"https://linkly.ai/docs/en/changelog#2026-08-14","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","large-language-model","llm","search"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.4.0/app.json","detailSha256":"b8b1baac2481a8cd99c39cd9833d76668a1d9004dc618140964530ab22dea46c","releaseDate":"2026-11-08","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"1.4.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.12.0/app.json","detailSha256":"856554034b9abf0a0c5344ffd4a13141a342ff276fad1d8d41467603a9022b35","releaseDate":"2026-08-14","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.12.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.11.0/app.json","detailSha256":"9131